  · refine st.seqD (nR .bD) rfl (lx_step  z.v z.o z.p.sp z.p.pa z.p.pc z.p.b (z.p.b % 28) z.p.cdp xc.x xc.r (xc.f xc.x) xc.M (cd st) (by cfacts st) (by cfacts st) (by side st) (by side st) (by side st) (by side st)) (by omega) (by omega) fun M1 h2 => ?_
